<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mobile-First Responsive Page</title>
    <style>      
        
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            /* Using flexible 'rem' for padding */
            padding: 1rem; 
        }

        header {
            background: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            /* Flexible width using percentage */
            width: 100%; 
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column; /* Stacked layout for mobile */
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .card {
            background: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 5%;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        
        .responsive-img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

      

        
        @media (min-width: 600px) {
            body {
                padding: 2rem;
            }
            
            .container {
                flex-direction: row; /* Side-by-side layout */
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }

            .card {
                flex: 1; /* Cards grow equally to fill space */
                min-width: 250px;
            }
        }

        
        @media (min-width: 1024px) {
            header {
                font-size: 2rem;
                padding: 4rem;
            }

            .container {
                max-width: 1200px;
                margin: 0 auto; 
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Responsive Design</h1>
        <p>Built with a Mobile-First approach</p>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        <section class="card">
            <h2>Flexible Units</h2>
            <p>This layout uses <strong>%</strong>, <strong>rem</strong>, and <strong>flexbox</strong> to ensure it adapts to any screen size.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>Media Queries</h2>
            <p>On mobile, these cards stack. On tablets and desktops, they sit side-by-side automatically.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>Adaptive Content</h2>
            <p>Resize your browser window to see the layout shift and the text adjust.</p>
        </section>
    </main>

</body>
</html>
